# "Activate only if you control a Plains or a Swamp": an Island does not enable the {W} ability (turn 3, refused), a Swamp
# does (turn 5, the positive control), and the Verge itself - neither a Plains nor a Swamp - never enabled it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Bleachbone Verge
Island
Swamp
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Bleachbone Verge.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
! Bot1.Battlefield.Bleachbone Verge.Activate(Ability: {W})
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Bleachbone Verge.Activate(Ability: {W})
? Bot1.Mana = {W}

[Expect]
Bot1.Mana = {W}
